From 657f998bbc96699d5c1d3e56bac7ae36629a7107 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:57:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(build): the gate reports VOID when the checkout moves
 during a run

cargo xtask gate reads HEAD and git status --porcelain at start, before each
step and at the end. A change prints a VOID line naming what moved and exits 1
with no verdict. Detection only: no lock, no hook. AGENTS.md and work-issue say
a worktree agent never switches, pulls, merges or resets in the main checkout.

PROCESS_VERSION 30: xtask and the process docs changed.

Fixes #1201
Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
